{
    "attributes": {
        "action": "Fund minimum wage for student nurses for their 2300-hour NHS clinical practice",
        "additional_details": "We believe student nurses need to be paid for the 2300 hours they work during placements. We feel every hour worked on placement deserves at least the same wage as the national minimum wage.",
        "background": "Many student nurses get into thousands of pounds worth of student debt, can\u2019t work alongside placement and get worked to the core, up to 40 hours per week of unpaid work, plus they have to pay for their NMC PIN number at the end.",
